<div classname="{styles.pvlRoot}">
	<div style="background-color:;display:block !important;" class="p-6 rounded-5 bg-light mb-18" data-zesty-id="design:columns:1 Column:7:66">
<div class="column" data-zesty-id="design:columns:1 Column:7:66-1:1 Column:0">
<h5 style="text-align:center;" data-zesty-id="content:text:1:69">Donate Food</h5>
<div class="py-5" data-zesty-id="design:design:whitespace-xl:2:45"></div>
<div style="color:#111111;" class="rounded p-6 gap-3 bg-light text-dark" data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:3:72"><p>
	Each day, The Salvation Army assists individuals and families in crisis with emergency groceries through our <a href="/metro-atlanta/financial-emergency-services" target=""><span style="color:#ed1c2b;">Financial Emergency Services Centers</span></a>.
</p>

<p>
	We currently have an <strong><span style="color:#ed1c2b;">URGENT NEED</span></strong> for the items listed below:
</p>

<p>
	Breakfast items (breakfast bars, pancake mix, etc.)
</p>

<p>
	Boxes/bags Of rice
</p>

<p>
	Full sized boxes of dry breakfast cereal (low sugar)
</p>

<p>
	Canisters/boxes Of oatmeal
</p>

<p>
	Boxes/bags Of pasta
</p>

<p>
	Bags of dried beans
</p>

<p>
	Crackers
</p>

<p>
	Peanut butter (plastic jars only)
</p>

<p>
	Powdered baby formula
</p>

<p>
	Baby food (all types)
</p>

<p>
	Donations of non-perishable food items may be delivered to your nearest <a href="/metro-atlanta/financial-emergency-services" target=""><span style="color:#ed1c2b;">Salvation Army Financial Emergency Services Center</span></a>.  
</p>

<p>
	<em>Please contact your desired location for operating hours.</em>
</p>

<p>
	 
</p>

<h5 style="text-align:center;"><span style="font-size:20px;">Donate Food Through Our Amazon Wishlist</span></h5>

<p>
	Shop, click, and send the food straight to one of The Salvation Army locations! A few items may appear to be out of stock without the “Add to Cart” button; by clicking “See all buying options”, shoppers can find the items available through another vendor on Amazon. 
</p>

<p style="text-align:center;" class="cta-button-group d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 my-3 justify-content-center"><a href="https://www.amazon.com/hz/wishlist/ls/3MS4DIU0ONVXJ?ref_=wl_share" class="btn btn-secondary gap-1 mt-2">Donate Today&nbsp;</a></p>

<p>
	 
